[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2770783146","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104871#issuecomment-2770783146","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104871","id":2770783146,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lJsuq","user":{"login":"Dx-hualuo","id":54300227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzAwMjI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54300227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dx-hualuo","html_url":"https://github.com/Dx-hualuo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dx-hualuo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dx-hualuo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dx-hualuo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dx-hualuo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dx-hualuo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dx-hualuo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dx-hualuo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dx-hualuo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dx-hualuo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-01T22:01:15Z","updated_at":"2025-04-01T22:01:15Z","body":"Godot appears to have poor support for loading multiple assemblies.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2770783146/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2779894641","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104871#issuecomment-2779894641","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104871","id":2779894641,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lsdNx","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-04T23:24:42Z","updated_at":"2025-04-04T23:24:42Z","body":"> And configured this as a Godot tools project:\n>\n> ```csproj\n> <IsGodotToolsProject>true</IsGodotToolsProject>\n> ```\n\n`IsGodotToolsProject` is an internal property, we use it to determine which is the [`GodotTools`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4b36c0491edcecb1f800bc59ef2995921999c3c0/modules/mono/editor/GodotTools/GodotTools/GodotTools.csproj) assembly and will likely have unexpected consequences, its behavior may also change in future versions.\n\n> when declaring Godot-related types (like using Node2D as a parent class) in my tools project, and having project scripts inherit through `MyNode2D -> NuGetAssemblyNode2D -> Node2D`, the implementation fails to work properly.\n\nWe don't officially support defining scripts outside the main Godot project assembly. While it may be possible to trick Godot into making this \"work\", these tricks can still fail in a number of ways.\n\nClosing to consolidate on https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/75352.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2779894641/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]